# Everything below is reproducible from the tracked source. Together they are ~2.6 GB
# against 0.7 MB of actual source, and none of it belongs in history.

# ── build products ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# scripts/build.mjs output, the installer payload, and the packaged installers.
/dist/
/dist-installer/
/build/

# A project-local npm cache used while assembling the runtime.
/.npm-cache/
node_modules/

# ── regenerated from tracked assets on every build ──────────────────────────
# `npm run icons` rasterizes assets/app-mark.svg; the output is deterministic, so
# these only appear here because they are outputs, not because they churn.
# docs/ is NOT ignored wholesale: README links to the screenshots in it.
/app/assets/icon.png

# ── local noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
